git subtree split --prefix=app/ctf-apps/content-anchor -b content-anchor-public

Whenever you make changes in your main repository, you can update the public repo with:
git subtree split --prefix=app/ctf-apps/content-anchor -b content-anchor-public
git push public content-anchor-public:main


Add the new remote
git remote add public https://github.com/chigoKawa/Content-Anchor---Contentful-App.git
git push public content-anchor-public:main


 Usage

  # Build only
  npm run ctf-app:build  -- auto-translate-article
  npm run ctf-app:build  -- compliance-review

  # Build + upload (needs env vars)
  npm run ctf-app:upload -- auto-translate-article
  npm run ctf-app:upload -- compliance-review

  # List available apps
  npm run ctf-app:build